        {
          "text": " Eryo izooba Abaisraeli abariba batsigaireho, n'ab'enju ya Yakobo abariba bahonokireho, tibarigaruka kwegamira owaabateire, kureka omu mazima baryayegamira MUKAMA Orikwera wa Israeli. ",
