        {
          "text": " Kwonka, n'obu abantu baawe Abaisraeli baraabe nibaingana nk'omusheenyi gw'aha nyanja, ekicweka kyabo kikye ekirihonokaho nikyo kirigaruka. Okucwekyerera kukaragiirwa, kushandaarira hamwe n'okuhikiirira, ",
