        {
          "text": "Nikyo Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe, arikugirira ati: Imwe bantu banguye 'mwe, abatwire Saayuuni, mutatiina Abaasiria, ku baraabateeze enkoni, baababangira ebihuuzo, baabagira nk'oku Abanyamisri baabagizire, ",
