        {
          "text": " MUKAMA ow'amahe arybaasha, nk'oku yaagizire Midiani aha rukiri rwa Orebu, kandi enkoni ye aryagiimutsya aha nyanja, agibangye, nk'oku yaagizire omuri Misri. ",
